<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>{% block title %}{{ title }}{% endblock %}</title>

  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
  <link href="/content/style/_main.css?v=2026.03.20" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" />
  <link href="/content/pagefind/pagefind-ui.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" />

  <link href="/content/style/tailwind.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" />

  <meta property="og:locale" content="en" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="yareli's press" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:logo" content="{{ "/content/images/icon.jpg" | htmlBaseUrl: "https://yareli.nekoweb.org" }}" />
  {% block meta %}
  <meta property="og:title" content="{{ title }}" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="{{ page.url | htmlBaseUrl: "https://yareli.nekoweb.org" }}" />
  <meta property="og:image" content="{{ "/content/images/icon.jpg" | htmlBaseUrl: "https://yareli.nekoweb.org" }}" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="occasional essays and letters on video games, manga, personal, et al." />

  <meta property="twitter:card" content="summary">
  <meta property="twitter:site" content="@alittleyareli">
  <meta property="twitter:domain" content="yareli.nekoweb.org">
  <meta property="twitter:url" content="{{ page.url | htmlBaseUrl: "https://yareli.nekoweb.org" }}">
  <meta property="twitter:title" content="{{ title }}">
  <meta property="twitter:image" content="{{ "/content/images/icon.jpg" | htmlBaseUrl: "https://yareli.nekoweb.org" }}">
  <meta property="twitter:description" content="occasional essays and letters on video games, manga, personal, et al.">
  {% endblock %}
</head>

<body>
  <main id="page" class="flex min-h-screen">
    <div class="fixed top-0 start-0 z-20 px-0 pt-0.5 w-full type text-sm bg">
      <div class="marquee">
        <div class="marquee-content">
          <span>i have an unhealthy tendency to believe in ghosts when telling ghost stories.</span>
          <span>///</span>
          <span>the sun has sent her messenger. do not relent. look inward and come ablaze.</span>
          <span>///</span>
          <span>like, ask the slug to meet you on the other end of the salt mine and you get no more slug.</span>
          <span>///</span>
          <span>is it a return or a failure to succumb to the tide?</span>
          <span>///</span>
        </div>
        <div class="marquee-content" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>i have an unhealthy tendency to believe in ghosts when telling ghost stories.</span>
          <span>///</span>
          <span>the sun has sent her messenger. do not relent. look inward and come ablaze.</span>
          <span>///</span>
          <span>like, ask the slug to meet you on the other end of the salt mine and you get no more slug.</span>
          <span>///</span>
          <span>is it a return or a failure to succumb to the tide?</span>
          <span>///</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <hr class="w-full border-b bc">
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto my-10 w-full px-4 md:px-8 lg:w-11/12 xl:w-4/5">
      <div class="w-full mb-2 sm:mb-3 border-4 border-double bc bg">
        <header class="flex flex-wrap px-2 bg-white">
          <div class="flex-none pt-1.5">
            <button type="button" data-theme-toggle>
              <img class="theme-icon" src="//img.icons8.com/?size=20&id=60002&format=png&color=000000" />
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="flex-initial ml-auto">
            <span class="type text-xxs sm:text-xs text-right dc">
              <a class="link" href="https://x.com/alittleyareli">twitter</a> /
              <a class="link" href="https://backloggd.com/u/alittleyareli/">backloggd</a> /
              <a class="link" href="https://ko-fi.com/alittleyareli">ko-fi</a>
            </span>
          </div>
        </header>
    
        <img class="w-full max-h-32 md:max-h-40 object-cover brightness-50" src="/content/images/banner.jpg" />
        <div class="w-full bg-i">
          <nav class="flex flex-wrap h-full">
            <div class="flex-initial px-1.5 sm:px-3 pt-1 pb-0.5">
              <h1 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase fg-i">
                <a class="link" href="/">Home{% if page.url == "/" %}*{% endif %}</a>
              </h1>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-initial px-1.5 sm:px-3 pt-1 pb-0.5">
              <h1 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase fg-i">
                <a class="link" href="/pages/archive/">
                  Archive{% if page.url == "/pages/archive/" %}*{% endif %}{% if page.url contains "/posts/" %}^{% endif %}
                </a>
              </h1>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-initial px-1.5 sm:px-3 pt-1 pb-0.5">
              <h1 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase fg-i">
                <a class="link" href="/pages/garden/">Garden{% if page.url == "/pages/garden/" %}*{% endif %}</a>
              </h1>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-initial px-1.5 sm:px-3 pt-1 pb-0.5">
              <h1 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase fg-i">
                <a class="link" href="/pages/about/">About{% if page.url == "/pages/about/" %}*{% endif %}</a>
              </h1>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-none ml-auto pr-1 sm:pr-2 pt-1 sm:pt-0.5">
              <a class="link" href="/posts.xml">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="icon">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3.75 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h.75c8.284 0 15 6.716 15 15v.75a.75.75 0 0 1-.75.75h-.75a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-.75C18 11.708 12.292 6 5.25 6H4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75V4.5Zm0 6.75a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h.75a8.25 8.25 0 0 1 8.25 8.25v.75a.75.75 0 0 1-.75.75H12a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-.75a6 6 0 0 0-6-6H4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-.75Zm0 7.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 3 0 1.5 1.5 0 0 1-3 0Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </div>

      {% block content %}{{ content }}{% endblock %}
    </div>
  </main>

  <script src="/content/scripts/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>